{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:10.75.020","page_type":"section"},"citation":"10.75.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","content_hash":"4f5b502718f1d02b631818b3470afee87e344924b245e3d2b3cccb8b6e48cdab","heading":"Penalty for violation of chapter.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","text":"Penalties for violation of this chapter shall be as follows:\n(a) For overweight in excess of 100 pounds and not in excess of 500 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $50.00.\n(b) For overweight in excess of 500 pounds and not in excess of 1,000 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $75.00.\n(c) For overweight in excess of 1,000 pounds and not in excess of 1,500 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $150.00.\n(d) For overweight in excess of 1,500 pounds and not in excess of 2,000 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $200.00.\n(e) For overweight in excess of 2,000 pounds and not in excess of 20,000 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $0.10 for every pound overweight.\n(f) For overweight in excess of 20,000 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $0.30 for every pound overweight. (Code 1981 § 43-672. Code 1995 § 142-737.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"dea9b262-2e14-5aa5-8bff-1e179e4178be"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.75.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","content_hash":"d51acc125f1c4f7f4659fc95d0fc5089b715ff8e294f19cda8851f543188ea12","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","text":"Penalties for violation of this chapter shall be as follows:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"400a61c0-7b8a-51be-8eb4-8224ba683bc2"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.75.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","content_hash":"69deb9f9cdced955c40a9f7e9a8c7b6f041345301d5a0ffa5ab14383e1aee0f1","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","text":"(a) For overweight in excess of 100 pounds and not in excess of 500 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $50.00.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"f45eed7d-8002-54ba-8a73-fd317a349140"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.75.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","content_hash":"756a08765e89d61f7c5917786766d5f8a8dd554e804a8e030a73976836195a8b","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","text":"(b) For overweight in excess of 500 pounds and not in excess of 1,000 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $75.00.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"69f574f4-6f05-597c-bd7e-24004f33d429"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.75.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","content_hash":"d11b9ab0e3470b091a402eb8fd96a76259a197e7334f036ae48be366785cd222","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","text":"(c) For overweight in excess of 1,000 pounds and not in excess of 1,500 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $150.00.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"3264bddc-40bd-5169-95ed-d69d46b87184"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.75.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","content_hash":"91cd697d990ea41f353d52cd2a0895972eb08f671aefa5035d03598022dea68b","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","text":"(d) For overweight in excess of 1,500 pounds and not in excess of 2,000 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $200.00.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4e943b3f-8c3c-5dcc-a066-194787fcc99d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.75.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","content_hash":"a1b8d233e26b7c6e9749fcb412937dde2861aaafa125745840d387ecf96765a5","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","text":"(e) For overweight in excess of 2,000 pounds and not in excess of 20,000 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $0.10 for every pound overweight.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1bb5a81c-28cc-5646-b2d4-3f2c9430fa04"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.75.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","content_hash":"953650443ab8cb79f837d36ab0357f3651139a3db59cfa2d9fdfd93e23948cbb","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.75.020","text":"(f) For overweight in excess of 20,000 pounds, total weight or weight per axle or combination of axles, $0.30 for every pound overweight. (Code 1981 § 43-672. Code 1995 § 142-737.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"89fe1ba4-0404-5570-b479-bb78f2c657ae"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.75.020:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}